              "text": "il freno — \"the brake\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il freno della bici non funziona. The brake on the bike does not work."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Il freno a mano is the handbrake. Figuratively, senza freni means without restraint."
